#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/login_steps.js
#: apps/captchas/static/captchas/js/captcha.js
msgid "Captcha"
msgstr "验证码"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/login_steps.js
msgid "Two-step verification code"
msgstr "两步验证码"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/login_steps.js
msgid ""
"One more step: open the authenticator app on your phone and enter the 6 "
"digits it shows for this site now."
msgstr "还差一步：打开手机上的验证器 App，输入这个网站现在显示的 6 位数字。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/login_steps.js
msgid ""
"The password is right. Open the authenticator app on your phone and enter "
"the 6 digits it shows for this site now."
msgstr "密码对了。打开手机上的验证器 App，输入这个网站现在显示的 6 位数字。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/login_steps.js
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "验证"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/login_steps.js
msgid "Please enter the 6 digits."
msgstr "请输入 6 位数字。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Default permissions"
msgstr "默认权限"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
#: apps/sso/static/sso/js/manage_sso.js
#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"Visitors who aren't logged in act as this user: its permissions are what "
"visitors can do. Disable it and nothing can be seen without logging in."
msgstr ""
"没登录的访客用这个身份：它的权限就是访客能做的事。停用它，没登录就什么都看不"
"了。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"Accounts that single sign-on creates later start with a copy of its default "
"permissions and storage source permissions."
msgstr "以后单点登录新建的账号，一开始复制它的默认权限和存储源权限。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"Can open the Manage page and the Django admin. Superusers are made at "
"installation, with the createsuperuser command or in the Django admin."
msgstr ""
"能进管理页和后台。超级管理员在安装时、用 createsuperuser 命令或在后台设置。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Can open the Manage page."
msgstr "能进管理页。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"This is the built-in \"Anonymous user\": visitors who aren't logged in act "
"as it, and its permissions are what visitors can do. Its name can't be "
"changed and it has no password; turn the switch below off and nothing can be "
"seen without logging in."
msgstr ""
"这是内置的「匿名用户」：没登录的访客用这个身份，它的权限就是访客能做的事。它"
"的名字不能改，也没有密码；关掉下面的开关，没登录就什么都看不了。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"This is the built-in \"New user template\": accounts that single sign-on "
"creates later start with a copy of its default permissions and storage "
"source permissions. Its name can't be changed, and it can't log in."
msgstr ""
"这是内置的「虚拟新用户」：以后单点登录新建的账号，一开始复制它的默认权限和存"
"储源权限。它的名字不能改，也不能登录。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Built-in"
msgstr "内置"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Logging in also asks for the digits in a phone authenticator app"
msgstr "登录时还要输入手机验证器 App 上的数字"

