#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"Access without logging in is allowed now (with the anonymous user's "
"permissions)."
msgstr "已允许没登录的人访问（按匿名用户的权限）。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Anonymous access is off: nothing can be seen without logging in."
msgstr "已关闭匿名访问：没登录就什么都看不了。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "%(username)s is enabled."
msgstr "已启用 %(username)s。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"%(username)s is disabled: they can't log in, and were logged out where "
"logged in."
msgstr "已停用 %(username)s：他登录不了了，已经登录的也退出了。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"Save this user in \"Basic info\" first, then set their permissions on each "
"storage source."
msgstr "先在「基本信息」里保存这个用户，再设置他在每个存储源上的权限。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Storage source management isn't ready yet."
msgstr "存储源管理还没有装好。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"Save this user in \"Basic info\" first, then link their single sign-on "
"accounts."
msgstr "先在「基本信息」里保存这个用户，再绑定他的单点登录账号。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Single sign-on isn't ready yet."
msgstr "单点登录还没有装好。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Edit user \"%(username)s\""
msgstr "编辑用户「%(username)s」"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "New user"
msgstr "新建用户"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"At least 8 characters, not too common and not all digits. Left empty, the "
"account can't log in with a password for now"
msgstr ""
"至少 8 位，不能太常见，也不能全是数字。不填的话，这个账号暂时不能用密码登录"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Leave empty to keep it. Once changed, their logins on every device end"
msgstr "不改就留空。改了以后，他在所有设备上的登录都会失效"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "They have no password now and can't log in with one"
msgstr "他现在没有密码，不能用密码登录"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Once off, people who aren't logged in see no storage sources."
msgstr "关掉以后，没登录的人就看不到任何存储源了。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"Once disabled, the user can't log in, and is logged out right away where "
"already logged in."
msgstr "停用后不能登录，已经登录的也会马上退出。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Role"
msgstr "身份"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Last login IP"
msgstr "最近登录 IP"

