msgstr "显示密码"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Copy user \"%(username)s\""
msgstr "复制用户「%(username)s」"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "A new username is required."
msgstr "要填新用户名。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Copied as %(username)s."
msgstr "已复制为 %(username)s。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Copied as %(username)s (no password yet)."
msgstr "已复制为 %(username)s（还没有密码）。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "Delete user \"%(username)s\"?"
msgstr "删除用户「%(username)s」？"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid ""
"Their permissions on every storage source and their shares are deleted too; "
"their entries in the activity log stay. This can't be undone."
msgstr ""
"这个用户在每个存储源上的权限和分享会一起删除，操作日志里的记录留着。删除以后"
"不能恢复。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/manage_users.js
msgid "%(username)s deleted."
msgstr "已删除 %(username)s。"

#: apps/accounts/static/accounts/js/totp.js
msgid ""
"After the password, logging in also asks for the 6 digits an authenticator "
"app on your phone shows: someone who knows your password still can't log in. "
"Any app that supports TOTP works, like Google Authenticator or Microsoft "
"Authenticator."
msgstr ""
"登录时输完密码，还要输入手机上验证器 App 显示的 6 位数字：别人知道了你的密码"
"也登录不了。可以用 Google 身份验证器、Microsoft Authenticator 等支持 TOTP 的 "
"App。"

