#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Authorize"
msgstr "授权"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "More settings"
msgstr "更多设置"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Copying failed. Please select and copy it by hand"
msgstr "复制失败，请手动选中复制"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Put this address of the site in the app's redirect URI (callback URL):"
msgstr "在应用的重定向 URI（回调地址）里填本站的这个地址："

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Downloads and uploads"
msgstr "下载和上传"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Like https://dl.example.com"
msgstr "例如 https://dl.example.com"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Optional. When set, download links are this address plus the file's path in "
"the storage source, and your own web server or CDN serves the files (WebDAV "
"can use its own address too, if it allows anonymous downloads); when empty, "
"this site passes downloads on."
msgstr ""
"可选。填了以后，下载链接是这个地址加上文件在存储源里的路径，由你自己的 Web 服"
"务器或 CDN 提供这些文件（WebDAV 也可以填它自己的地址，前提是允许匿名下载）；"
"不填就由本站转发下载。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Download through the site"
msgstr "代理下载"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"When on, downloads go through this site to users instead of browsers "
"downloading straight from the storage. It takes a lot of the server's "
"bandwidth; only turn it on when needed."
msgstr ""
"打开后，下载先经过本站再给用户，而不是让浏览器直接从存储下载。很占服务器的带"
"宽，确有需要再打开。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Upload through the site"
msgstr "代理上传"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"When on, uploads go to this site first and then on to the storage, instead "
"of browsers uploading straight to the storage. It takes a lot of the "
"server's bandwidth; only turn it on when needed."
msgstr ""
"打开后，上传先传到本站，再由本站传给存储，而不是由浏览器直接传给存储。很占服"
"务器的带宽，确有需要再打开。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Download link lifetime (seconds)"
msgstr "下载链接有效期（秒）"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"How long download links signed by this site and the storage's own signed "
"links last: 1800 seconds (half an hour) by default, 7 days at most."
msgstr ""
"本站签名的下载链接和存储自己的签名链接多久以后失效，默认 1800 秒（半小时），"
"最长 7 天。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Permanent download links"
msgstr "永久下载链接"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"When on, download links from this site don't expire (they're still signed "
"and download only that file). \"New link key\" below makes all earlier "
"permanent links stop working."
msgstr ""
"打开后，本站给的下载链接不会过期（仍然带签名，只能下载那一个文件）。下面的"
"「换一个链接密钥」能让以前的永久链接全部失效。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"When on, download links from this site don't expire (they're still signed "
"and download only that file). Later, \"New link key\" in the storage "
"source's settings makes all earlier permanent links stop working."
msgstr ""
"打开后，本站给的下载链接不会过期（仍然带签名，只能下载那一个文件）。以后在存"
"储源的设置里点「换一个链接密钥」，能让以前的永久链接全部失效。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Download links force downloading"
msgstr "下载链接强制下载"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"When on, browsers always save the file; when off, opening a download link "
"directly (a copied one or a direct link, say) shows files the browser can "
"show (pictures, PDFs and so on). The \"Download\" buttons on the pages "
"always save the file."
msgstr ""
"打开时浏览器总是保存文件；关掉时，直接打开下载链接（比如复制出去的、直链），"
"能在浏览器里显示的文件（图片、PDF 等）就直接显示。页面上的「下载」按钮总是保"
"存文件。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "New link key"
msgstr "换一个链接密钥"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Change the link key?"
msgstr "换一个链接密钥？"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"All permanent download links this storage source gave before stop working, "
"and time-limited links stop before they expire."
msgstr "这个存储源以前给出的永久下载链接会全部失效，有时效的链接到期前也失效。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Link key changed"
msgstr "已更换链接密钥"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Connections at once"
msgstr "同时连接数"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"How many downloads through this site the storage source sends at once. Every "
"connection counts: each of the connections a download tool opens, and each "
"picture a gallery page loads."
msgstr ""
"这个存储源经过本站同时发送几个下载。每个连接都算一个：下载工具开的每个连接，"
"画廊加载的每张图片。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Send to the storage's own link"
msgstr "转到存储源自己的链接"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Answer 429 (Too Many Requests)"
msgstr "返回 429（请求过多）"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "When all are in use"
msgstr "连接数满了时"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"With the storage's own link, the download comes straight from the storage: "
"it only works if people can reach the storage, and this site's limits per IP "
"don't apply to it. With 429, they're told to try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"转到存储源自己的链接时，文件直接从存储源下载：访问者要能连上存储源，本站对单"
"个 IP 的限制也管不到它。返回 429 时，对方会被告知稍后再试。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
