msgstr "授权的结果已经填进表单，点「保存」生效。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"The authorization result has expired (over 6 hours old, or saved already); "
"authorize again if needed."
msgstr ""
"授权的结果已经过期了（超过 6 小时，或者已经保存过），需要的话请重新授权。"

