#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Log in and agree in the window that opens; when done, you come back here."
msgstr "在打开的窗口里登录并同意授权，完成后会自动回到这里。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Authorization didn't finish: the reason is in the authorization window. You "
"can click \"Authorize\" again."
msgstr "授权没有完成：原因写在授权的窗口里。可以再点一次「授权」。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Add storage source · Manage"
msgstr "添加存储源 · 管理"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Steps to add a storage source"
msgstr "添加存储源的步骤"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Add storage source"
msgstr "添加存储源"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Keys"
msgstr "密钥"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Other settings"
msgstr "其他设置"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Next"
msgstr "下一步"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgctxt "wizard"
msgid "Back"
msgstr "上一步"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Can't change once saved: settings and paths mean nothing for another type."
msgstr "保存以后不能改：换了类型，参数和路径就没有意义了。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"First give it a name and choose the storage type. The settings for "
"connecting come next and the rest at the end; all can be changed later."
msgstr ""
"先起个名字、选好存储的类型。连接要用的设置在下一步填，其他设置放在最后，以后"
"都可以再改。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Fill in where this storage is. After saving, the next step tests the "
"connection."
msgstr "填上这个存储的位置。保存以后，下一步测试连接。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Register an app in the provider's developer console, add the callback URL "
"below to it, then fill in the app's ID and secret here. After saving, the "
"next step logs in to the account to authorize."
msgstr ""
"在服务商的开发者后台注册一个应用，把下面的回调地址加进去，再把应用的 ID 和密"
"码填在这里。保存以后，下一步登录帐户授权。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Fill in the app ID from the open platform. After saving, the next step is "
"scanning to log in."
msgstr "填上开放平台给的应用 ID。保存以后，下一步扫码登录。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Fill in the address and keys for connecting to this storage. After saving, "
"the next step tests the connection."
msgstr "填上连接这个存储要用的地址和密钥。保存以后，下一步测试连接。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Save and continue"
msgstr "保存并继续"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Already authorized. To use another account, authorize again."
msgstr "已经授权了。要换一个帐户，可以重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Click \"Authorize\", log in to the account and agree in the window that "
"opens; back here afterwards, the token is saved for you."
msgstr ""
"点「授权」，在打开的窗口里登录帐户、同意授权；完成以后回到这里，令牌自动保"
"存。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Authorize again"
msgstr "重新授权"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Already logged in. To use another account, scan again."
msgstr "已经登录了。要换一个帐户，可以重新扫码。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Click \"Scan to log in\" and scan the QR code with the phone app; after "
"logging in, the token is saved for you."
msgstr "点「扫码登录」，用手机应用扫二维码登录；登录以后令牌自动保存。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Scan again"
msgstr "重新扫码"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Scan to log in"
msgstr "扫码登录"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Connects to the storage once with the settings just saved, to see whether it "
"works."
msgstr "用刚才保存的设置连接一次存储，看看能不能用。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Not authorized yet: you can go on with the other settings, but it can't be "
"enabled before authorizing."
msgstr "还没有授权：也可以先往下设置，只是授权以前它启用不了。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "The connection works."
msgstr "连接正常。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Authorized and saved. %(result)s"
msgstr "授权成功，已经保存。%(result)s"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Testing the connection failed: %(message)s"
msgstr "测试连接时出错：%(message)s"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"The authorization result wasn't saved: %(message)s Please authorize again."
msgstr "授权的结果没有保存：%(message)s请重新授权。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Authorized and saved. Next, set: %(fields)s."
msgstr "授权成功，已经保存。下一步还要设置：%(fields)s。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Authorized and saved."
msgstr "授权成功，已经保存。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Authorization didn't finish: the reason is on the authorization page you "
"just saw. You can click \"Authorize\" again."
msgstr "授权没有完成：原因写在刚才的授权页上。可以再点一次「授权」。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"Fill in %(fields)s first; everything else has defaults, and all can be "
"changed later in the storage source's settings. Finishing checks the "
"connection, then enables the storage source."
msgstr ""
"先填好%(fields)s，其他的都有默认值；以后在存储源的设置里也能改。完成时会先检"
"查连接，再启用这个存储源。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "\"%(label)s\""
msgstr "「%(label)s」"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"These all have defaults, so you can click \"Done\" right away; they can be "
"changed later in the storage source's settings. Finishing checks the "
"connection, then enables the storage source."
msgstr ""
"这些都有默认值，可以直接点「完成」；以后在存储源的设置里也能改。完成时会先检"
"查连接，再启用这个存储源。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
