"By their default permissions, %(enabled)s user can use it (of %(users)s "
"users)."
msgid_plural ""
"By their default permissions, %(enabled)s users can use it (of %(users)s "
"users)."
msgstr[0] ""
"按各自的默认权限，%(enabled)s 个用户能使用它（共 %(users)s 个用户）。"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
