"By their default permissions, %(enabled)s user can use it once it's enabled "
"(of %(users)s users)."
msgid_plural ""
"By their default permissions, %(enabled)s users can use it once it's enabled "
"(of %(users)s users)."
msgstr[0] ""
"按各自的默认权限，启用以后 %(enabled)s 个用户能使用它（共 %(users)s 个用"
"户）。"

