msgstr "规则已保存"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid "Read README.md in folders"
msgstr "读取文件夹里的 README.md"

#: apps/storages/static/storages/js/manage_storages.js
msgid ""
"When on, the rules below no longer apply: opening a folder shows the "
"README.md in it (any case), always below the list."
msgstr ""
"打开后下面的规则不再生效：打开文件夹时显示它里面的 README.md（不分大小写），"
